        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>英语短语汇总 - 第3页</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 10px 12px 4px 12px;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", SimHei, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #000;\n    max-width: 560px;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .col {\n    flex: 1 1 0;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  .entry {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  .green {\n    color: #1e7d32;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .bold {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .sec {\n    background: #d6dde6;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 2px 4px;\n    margin: 6px 0 4px 0;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .sec.green-sec {\n    color: #1e7d32;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    padding-top: 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"columns\">\n\n  <!-- ================= COLUMN 1 ================= -->\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <p class=\"entry green\">go out 出去;熄灭;送出;播出</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">go over 仔细检查;复习,温习</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">go round 流有;四处走动</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">go through 翻阅;通过;经历</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">go up 上升,增长</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">go without 没有…也行</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">go wrong &nbsp;&nbsp;有故障;误入岐途</p>\n\n    <span class=\"sec\">have 短语</span>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have a gift for 有…的天赋</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have a go/try 试 一 试</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have a good/great time</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\">过得愉快</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have a population of...</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\">有…人口</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have affection for 喜爱,钟爱</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have an effect on/upon</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\">对…有影响</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have difficulty (in) doing sth</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\">做某事有困难</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have fun with/doing sth 乐</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\">于做某事</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have...in common</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\">有相同的特点</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have/gain access to 获得接</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\">近…的机会</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have nothing to do with</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\">与…无关</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">have a preference for 偏爱</p>\n\n    <span class=\"sec\">leave 短语</span>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">leave aside</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\">暂不考虑，搁置一边</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">leave behind 留下,忘带</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">leave for 出发去某地</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= COLUMN 2 ================= -->\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">leave off 停止 ，中断</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">leave office 离职</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">leave out 遗漏；不考虑，忽略</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">leave school 退学，离校</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">leave alone 不理，不干涉</p>\n\n    <span class=\"sec\">look 短语</span>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look about 四下环顾；查看</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look after &nbsp;照顾，看管</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look ahead 为将来打算</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look around for 四处寻找</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look away from 把目光移开</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look back &nbsp;回顾，回头看</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look back on/upon &nbsp;回顾</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look down on/upon 蔑视</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look for 寻找</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look forward to 盼望；期待</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look into 向…里面看；调查</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look on/upon...as 把…看作</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look out 向外看；注意；提防</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look out for 当心； 寻找</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look over 查看，检查</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look through 透过…看去；看</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\">穿；浏览</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look up &nbsp;查询；向上看</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">look up to &nbsp;尊敬；钦佩</p>\n\n    <span class=\"sec\">lose 短语</span>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">lose face &nbsp;丢脸</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">lose faith in &nbsp;不再信任…</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">lose heart 丧失勇气或信心</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">lose one’s way 迷路</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">lose sight 看不见；失去视力</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">lose sight of 看不见;消失</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">lose touch with 与..失去联系</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= COLUMN 3 ================= -->\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">lose track of 失去…的线索</p>\n    <p class=\"entry bold\">lose weight 减肥</p>\n\n    <span class=\"sec\">make 短语(1)</span>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a breakthrough</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">取得重大突破/进展</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a change 做出改变</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a choice 做出选择</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a comparison 下结论</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a deal 达成协议</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a decision 做出决定</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a difference</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">起(重要)作用；区别对待</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a fool of sb 愚弄某人</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a fortune 发财，赚钱</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a full recovery</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">完全康复</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a living 谋生</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a promise 许下诺言</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a remark 评论</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make a request 提出请求</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make an apology to sb 向某</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">人道歉</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make an appointment with</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">与…约会/预约</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make an effort/efforts 努力</p>\n\n    <span class=\"sec green-sec\">make 短语(2)</span>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make change 找零</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make ends meet</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">量入为出；使收支相抵</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make for 向前；有利于</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make friends with 和..交朋友</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make fun of 嘲弄;拿…开玩笑</p>\n    <p class=\"entry green\">make good use of 好好利用</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"footer\">第 3 页 共 11 页</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
